DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     Function eellffttcc__vveerrssiioonn() returns a project-wide identifier string that
     encodes the source revision of the project source tree.

     The returned identifier has four space-separated fields:

     _P_r_o_j_e_c_t_-_N_a_m_e    This is always “elftoolchain”.

     _P_r_o_j_e_c_t_-_B_r_a_n_c_h  The branch name for the project source tree.

     _B_u_i_l_d_-_O_S        The operating system that the tool chain was compiled
                     for.

     _V_e_r_s_i_o_n_-_N_u_m_b_e_r  A tree-wide version number extracted from the version
                     control system in use.

