     Function eellffttcc__pprrooggrraamm__vveerrssiioonn() returns a pointer to an internal charac‐
     ter buffer.

EEXXAAMMPPLLEESS
     To retrieve and print the current toolchain version identifier, use:

           #include <sys/types.h>
           #include <libelftc.h>

           (void) printf("%s\n", elftc_version());

     On the HEAD branch of the project's sources, when checked out using Sub‐
     version and compiled on a NetBSD host, this would print:
           “elftoolchain HEAD NetBSD svn:_R_E_V_I_N_F_O”
     where _R_E_V_I_N_F_O would be the current revision information for the project
     source tree.

EERRRROORRSS
     Function eellffttcc__pprrooggrraamm__vveerrssiioonn() always succeeds.

